{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmf7weTrVb8J45ZcBDq7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm not putting the 30,000 in a deposit today. I'm fairly sure about that. What decided it was the example right at the top: \"ההפקדות שלכם 70,000 ₪\" and next to it \"נשאר לכם 68,270 ₪\". So I'd end up with less than I put in? There's a small \"בכסף של היום\" button and the boxes say 1.8% interest against 2% inflation, so that's probably why. But that's the big number that stuck.\n\nI did get what I came for:\n- **How it works:** you leave the money in the bank for a set time, anything from a day to a few years. The bank pays interest. The interest can be \"קבועה\", \"משתנה\", or tied to the \"מדד\". At the end the money goes back to your עו\"ש, or it starts again automatically, depending on what you picked.\n- **What it pays:** the example uses \"1.8%\". Tax is \"15%\" of the interest, and it comes off automatically.\n- **What you give up:** you can't touch the money until the end. If you break it early there's a \"קנס\" (fine), and the page says \"האתר לא מחשב אותה\", so they don't work it out for you. It also says \"אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות\": no law gives you the money back if the bank goes under. That one scared me a bit.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n1. Title \"פיקדון\" and the first lines of \"מה זה\". Then the 68,270 ₪ box.\n2. The graph and the boxes under it: \"נשאר לכם\", \"מס 986.20\", \"ההפקדות שלכם 70,000\".\n3. The fields on the side (500, 10 שנים, 1.8, 2). I left them as they were.\n4. \"למה משתמשים בזה\": first line only, \"כסף שאתם יודעים מתי תצטרכו\".\n5. \"שווה לדעת\": the three one-liners.\n6. \"כסף נכנס ויוצא\": withdrawal \"בסוף התקופה שנקבעה בהסכם\".\n7. \"כמה זה עולה\": just \"דמי יציאה\".\n8. \"מיסוי\": the three cards and the red box about breaking a deposit.\n9. \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\": the first line.\n10. I got to the \"מונחים\" table and stopped there. I didn't open screens 7–8.\n\n**Skipped:** \"הצגה כטבלה\", \"הצגת החוקים והכללים\", \"הצגת כל הבדיקות\", \"כמה העמלות האלה עולות לאורך זמן\", the grey small print, and the long paragraph about פטור, ניירות ערך and the TXI codes.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"TXI-03\", \"BANK-06\", \"TXI OQ14\" and the other codes, \"מק\"מ\", \"מוצרי שוק הכסף\", \"חשבון במערכת סגורה\", \"הבטחת קרן\", \"ריבית הריאלית\", \"פטור למעוט הכנסה\", \"מזומן שקלי\".\n\n**Where I got stuck or bored:**\n- The 70,000 vs 68,270 part. I couldn't tell if I'd actually lose money or if it's an inflation thing.\n- \"דמי יציאה\" says \"לפי התעריפון של הגורם המציע\". So I still have no idea how much it costs in shekels.\n- The example is Leumi's. Fine, I know them, but I don't know if other banks pay more.\n- By the \"מונחים\" table I'd have closed the page."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3649,"cache_read_input_tokens":11912,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3649},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04603ede-bb13-4fbe-8208-1af6cfcaa0ec","uuid":"87204c38-11af-414d-be3c-4b2eb41034e9","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:16:08.984Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmf7wJe38aD2wW3fy27X"}
